# What is in this repository and is **not** a page of the site.
#
# The site root used to be `docs/` inside CTRLRun/ctrlrun, so this file only had to exclude a
# handful of neighbours. The root is the whole repository now, which brings the tooling, the
# tests and the form API into view -- so each of them is named here. A file that is not a page
# and is not on this list is a page nobody meant to publish.

# The maintainers' documents.
README.md
IA.md
STYLE.md
SEO.md
BUILD-PROMPTS-*.md

# The capability source and the rendered fragments pages embed. A render is a fragment, not a
# page: `index.mdx` and `docs/production/index.mdx` include them.
capabilities.yaml
generated/

# Source assets and the browser verification scripts. `images/` is the published set.
assets/

# The checks, their tooling, and this repository's own configuration.
tests/
tools/
scripts/
.github/
pyproject.toml
LICENSE

# The Vercel Function behind the review form. It is deployed by Vercel, not by Mintlify.
website-form/
